We are such stuff as dreams are made,
so formed by the hand of fate's cruel art;
we crown this stage with trembling words,

plays.verse:
Tell me, Muse of Echoes, of the wanderer with many roads,
He roams beyond the mist, his steps unswayed, no shadow casts his door;
When dawn ascends o'er this silent town, his fate is sealed, as fate would make...

